{"seq":1,"slug":"subgraph-development","title":"子图开发：多语言实现与最佳实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/graphql-federation/implementation/subgraph-development","wordCount":621,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"子图开发-多语言实现与最佳实践\">子图开发：多语言实现与最佳实践</h1><p>在 Federation 架构中，子图（Subgraph）是真正承载业务逻辑和数据解析的服务。任何能实现 Federation Subgraph Specification 的 GraphQL 服务器都可以作为子图——不同团队可以选择最适合自己技术栈的语言和框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>无论使用何种语言，一个合格的 Federation 子图必须满足以下协议：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要求</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>_service</code> 查询</td>\n<td>返回子图的 SDL（含 Federation 指令）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>_entities</code> 查询</td>\n<td>接收 representations 数组，返回对应实体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@link</code> 声明</td>\n<td>顶层 schema 声明使用的 Federation 版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reference resolvers</td>\n<td>每个 <code>@key</code> 实体提供按 key 查找的解析器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[子图服务启动] --&gt; B{实现 Federation Spec}&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;_service → 供组合引擎读取 SDL&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;_entities → 供 Router 运行时解析&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;reference resolver → 按 key 批量查找&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[Schema Registry]&#10;    D --&gt; G[Router Query Plan]\">graph TD\n    A[子图服务启动] --&gt; B{实现 Federation Spec}\n    B --&gt; C[\"_service → 供组合引擎读取 SDL\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"_entities → 供 Router 运行时解析\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"reference resolver → 按 key 批量查找\"]\n    C --&gt; F[Schema Registry]\n    D --&gt; G[Router Query Plan]</pre><h2 id=\"node-js-apollo-server-apollo-subgraph\">Node.js：Apollo Server + @apollo/subgraph</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { ApolloServer } from &#39;@apollo/server&#39;;&#10;import { buildSubgraphSchema } from &#39;@apollo/subgraph&#39;;&#10;import { parse } from &#39;graphql&#39;;&#10;&#10;const typeDefs = parse(`&#10;  extend schema @link(url: &quot;https://specs.apollo.dev/federation/v2.8&quot;&#10;    import: [&quot;@key&quot;, &quot;@shareable&quot;, &quot;@external&quot;, &quot;@requires&quot;])&#10;&#10;  type User @key(fields: &quot;id&quot;) {&#10;    id: ID!&#10;    name: String!&#10;    email: String!&#10;  }&#10;  type Query { user(id: ID!): User }&#10;`);&#10;&#10;const resolvers = {&#10;  Query: { user: (_, { id }) =&gt; userService.findById(id) },&#10;  User: { __resolveReference: (rep) =&gt; userLoader.load(rep.id) },&#10;};&#10;&#10;const server = new ApolloServer({&#10;  schema: buildSubgraphSchema({ typeDefs, resolvers }),&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ApolloServer } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@apollo/server'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { buildSubgraphSchema } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@apollo/subgraph'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { parse } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'graphql'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> typeDefs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  extend schema @link(url: \"https://specs.apollo.dev/federation/v2.8\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    import: [\"@key\", \"@shareable\", \"@external\", \"@requires\"])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  type User @key(fields: \"id\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    id: ID!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    name: String!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    email: String!</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  type Query { user(id: ID!): User }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> resolvers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  Query: { </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">user</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(id) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  User: { </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">__resolveReference</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> userLoader.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">load</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rep.id) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ApolloServer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  schema: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">buildSubgraphSchema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ typeDefs, resolvers }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"go-gqlgen-federation-插件\">Go：gqlgen + Federation 插件</h2><p>gqlgen 通过内置 Federation 插件支持子图。配置 <code>gqlgen.yml</code> 启用 <code>federation.version: 2</code>，然后实现 entity resolver 接口：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func (r *entityResolver) FindUserByID(ctx context.Context, id string) (*model.User, error) {&#10;    return r.userRepo.GetByID(ctx, id)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">entityResolver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">FindUserByID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">model</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">User</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.userRepo.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GetByID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>gqlgen 自动生成 <code>_entities</code> 和 <code>_service</code> 的处理逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rust-async-graphql-原生支持\">Rust：async-graphql 原生支持</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[derive(SimpleObject)]&#10;struct User { id: ID, name: String, email: String }&#10;&#10;struct Query;&#10;#[Object]&#10;impl Query {&#10;    #[graphql(entity)]&#10;    async fn find_user_by_id(&amp;self, ctx: &amp;Context&lt;&#39;_&gt;, id: ID) -&gt; Result&lt;User&gt; {&#10;        ctx.data::&lt;UserRepo&gt;()?.find_by_id(id).await&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(SimpleObject)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct User { id: ID, name: String, email: String }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Query;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[Object]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl Query {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[graphql(entity)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    async fn find_user_by_id(&#x26;self, ctx: &#x26;Context&#x3C;'_>, id: ID) -> Result&#x3C;User> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ctx.data::&#x3C;UserRepo>()?.find_by_id(id).await</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"子图开发最佳实践\">子图开发最佳实践</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>始终使用 DataLoader</strong>：entity resolver 被 Router 批量调用</li>\n<li><strong>隔离 Federation 关注点</strong>：reference resolver 与业务 resolver 分模块</li>\n<li><strong>最小化 @external</strong>：只声明确实 <code>@requires</code> 的字段</li>\n<li><strong>健康检查</strong>：暴露 <code>/health</code> 供 Router 做可用性检测</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"多语言兼容性矩阵\">多语言兼容性矩阵</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言/框架</th>\n<th>Federation 版本</th>\n<th>批量 entity</th>\n<th>维护状态(2026)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Apollo Server (Node.js)</td>\n<td>v2.8</td>\n<td>DataLoader</td>\n<td>活跃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GraphQL Yoga (Node.js)</td>\n<td>v2.8</td>\n<td>DataLoader</td>\n<td>活跃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gqlgen (Go)</td>\n<td>v2.7</td>\n<td>内置批量</td>\n<td>活跃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>async-graphql (Rust)</td>\n<td>v2.8</td>\n<td>DataLoader</td>\n<td>活跃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DGS (Java/Kotlin)</td>\n<td>v2.8</td>\n<td>BatchLoader</td>\n<td>Netflix 维护</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>子图核心契约是 <code>_service</code> + <code>_entities</code> + reference resolver</li>\n<li>Node.js/Go/Rust 生态都有成熟的 Federation 子图库</li>\n<li>DataLoader 是 reference resolver 的必备伴侣</li>\n<li>隔离 Federation 代码保持业务逻辑的可测试性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"gateway-selection\">网关选型：Apollo Router vs Hive Gateway</a>——子图搭好后如何选择网关</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../micro-frontends/mfe-frameworks/module-federation\">微前端中的模块联邦</a>——前端领域的联邦思想对比</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"子图测试策略\">子图测试策略</h2><p>Federation 子图的测试需要覆盖三个层面：</p>\n<p><strong>单元测试（Resolver 层）</strong>：独立测试每个 resolver 的业务逻辑，mock 掉数据源。reference resolver 也应有独立的单元测试。</p>\n<p><strong>集成测试（Schema 层）</strong>：使用 <code>@apollo/subgraph</code> 的测试工具验证 SDL 的正确性——确保 <code>_service</code> 返回有效 SDL、<code>_entities</code> 能正确解析各类型的 representation。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { ApolloServer } from &#39;@apollo/server&#39;;&#10;import { buildSubgraphSchema } from &#39;@apollo/subgraph&#39;;&#10;&#10;const server = new ApolloServer({&#10;  schema: buildSubgraphSchema({ typeDefs, resolvers }),&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 测试 _entities 解析&#10;const result = await server.executeOperation({&#10;  query: `query { _entities(representations: [{__typename: &quot;User&quot;, id: &quot;1&quot;}]) { ... on User { name } } }`,&#10;});&#10;expect(result.body.singleResult.data._entities[0].name).toBe(&#39;Alice&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ApolloServer } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@apollo/server'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { buildSubgraphSchema } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@apollo/subgraph'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ApolloServer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  schema: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">buildSubgraphSchema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ typeDefs, resolvers }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 测试 _entities 解析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> server.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">executeOperation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  query: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`query { _entities(representations: [{__typename: \"User\", id: \"1\"}]) { ... on User { name } } }`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result.body.singleResult.data._entities[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].name).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>契约测试（Federation 层）</strong>：在 CI 中运行 <code>rover subgraph check</code> 验证子图变更与整体 supergraph 的兼容性。这本质上是一种自动化的契约测试——确保子图的&quot;接口承诺&quot;不被打破。</p>\n<p><strong>端到端测试（Supergraph 层）</strong>：在 staging 环境中用完整的 Router + 所有子图运行关键查询路径的 E2E 测试。特别关注跨多子图的 entity 解析链路。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"子图开发：多语言实现与最佳实践","id":"子图开发-多语言实现与最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核